                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-rose-400"></i>
                        <span>100% Brand New In Box (BNIB) Original Official Store</span>
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
