                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
                        Selamat datang di toko resmi <strong class="text-white">Wild Nana</strong>. Temukan sepatu branded impianmu lengkap dengan info ukuran, spesifikasi detail, sisa stok, serta sistem pembayaran flexible: Cash, Angsuran/PayLater via E-Wallet (DANA, OVO, GoPay), hingga Transfer Bank Resmi (BCA, BSI, Mandiri / BM).
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start space-y-3 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-4 pt-2">
                        <a href="#katalog" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-center transition-all shadow-xl shadow-rose-600/30 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
                            <span>Cek Katalog & Tabel Stok</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i>
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Admin%20Wild%20Nana,%20mau%20konsultasi%20size%20dan%20sepatu" target="_blank" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-center transition-all flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
